{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space is Red</strong> is an alt-history sci-fi horror visual novel.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes place aboard a Soviet starship in an alternate future where the USSR still exists and competes with the US for dominance in space. After a hyperspace jump to evade an ambush, the crew finds itself near a mysterious planet in a poorly explored sector of the known galaxy. Strange occurrences begin, and suspicion grows among the crew that a traitor may be in their midst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/extras/spaceship01.png?t=1736935892\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The visuals are styled like a black-and-white comic book, drawing inspiration from retro-horror manga. Expect multiple endings, detective elements, numerous deaths, and, of course, an alien presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space is Red</strong> is a radical reimagining of the first Russian full-length visual novel, <i>\u00ab\u041a\u0440\u0430\u0441\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043a\u043e\u0441\u043c\u043e\u0441\u00bb</i> (<i>Red Space</i>), originally released in 2007. This game was never translated into English and has never been available digitally.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3357480?t=1736935892","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1736935892","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/e6cf5957f273ef469219cefefd59541d68a590da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1736935892","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/e6cf5957f273ef469219cefefd59541d68a590da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1736935892","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space is Red</strong> is an alt-history sci-fi horror visual novel.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes place aboard a Soviet starship in an alternate future where the USSR still exists and competes with the US for dominance in space. After a hyperspace jump to evade an ambush, the crew finds itself near a mysterious planet in a poorly explored sector of the known galaxy. Strange occurrences begin, and suspicion grows among the crew that a traitor may be in their midst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/extras/spaceship01.png?t=1736935892\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The visuals are styled like a black-and-white comic book, drawing inspiration from retro-horror manga. Expect multiple endings, detective elements, numerous deaths, and, of course, an alien presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space is Red</strong> is a radical reimagining of the first Russian full-length visual novel, <i>\u00ab\u041a\u0440\u0430\u0441\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043a\u043e\u0441\u043c\u043e\u0441\u00bb</i> (<i>Red Space</i>), originally released in 2007. This game was never translated into English and has never been available digitally.</p>","developers":["Febrvvm"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/header.jpg?t=1736935892","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<